# Remote Work Policy

## Overview
NexaTech embraces a remote-first culture. This policy outlines our approach to remote work and the expectations for remote employees.

## Eligibility
All employees are eligible to work remotely, subject to role requirements and manager approval.

## Work Hours
Remote employees are expected to maintain regular business hours in their local time zone and be available for meetings and collaboration.

## Equipment
The company provides a laptop, monitor, and a $500 stipend for home office setup.

## Communication
Remote employees must:
- Attend all required meetings via video conference
- Respond to messages within 4 business hours
- Keep their calendar up to date
- Use video during meetings when possible

## Security
Remote employees must:
- Use the company VPN for all work activities
- Secure their home network
- Lock their computer when away
- Not work from public Wi-Fi without VPN

